FRAMEPILOT — COMPLETE PRODUCT REDESIGN AND REBUILD

Project: A beginner-friendly mobile drawing and animation direction studio for AI-assisted video production

I want you to rebuild FramePilot as a substantially better Android application.

This is not a request to make the existing interface prettier, change a few colors, or add more buttons.

I want you to reconsider the entire user experience, information architecture, drawing workflow, animation workflow, underlying data model, and export system.

The objective is to create an application that feels as natural and inviting as a mobile drawing and animation app, while providing the creative control needed to plan complex motion graphics and communicate those instructions to AI coding agents such as OpenCode.

The app must be easy enough for a complete beginner to use, but capable enough to support sophisticated animation projects.

Do not sacrifice usability for technical sophistication.

Do not sacrifice creative freedom for simplicity.

The complexity should be available when needed, not permanently displayed.


